From 1450058beaf84d97067e1c47b78eb3c95629f886 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: workspace-agent <workspace.vm.agent@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:19:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/49] m3 viewer: world-space lighting, ambient, blend modes,
 alpha masks

- Light, eye and half vectors in world space; the half vector is
  light + eye. Specular uses +dot.
- No normal map: tangent-space normal (0, 0, 1).
- Initialize colour, emissive and the skinning bone matrix.
- Ambient 0.35; material flag 0x10 draws unshaded.
- Blend modes 1-5 per M3; blended batches do not write depth.
- Alpha from alpha mask layers 1 and 2.
---
 src/viewer/handlers/m3/modelinstance.ts       |   1 -
 src/viewer/handlers/m3/shaders/layers.glsl.ts |   5 +-
 .../handlers/m3/shaders/standard.frag.ts      | 101 ++++++++++--------
 .../handlers/m3/shaders/standard.vert.ts      |  26 ++---
 src/viewer/handlers/m3/standardmaterial.ts    |  51 +++++----
 5 files changed, 99 insertions(+), 85 deletions(-)

